 "facts": [
  {
   "claim": "The Scream (1893, tempera and crayon/pastel on cardboard, 91 x 73.5 cm) by Edvard Munch is in the National Museum, Oslo (NG.M.00939); the painted 1893 version is on display there (museum opened 2022)",
   "source": "https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/collection/object/NG.M.00939 ; https://munch.no/en/The-Scream/where-can-i-see-the-scream/ ; https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-scream-gets-a-new-home-in-norways-650m-museum-180980233/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "At the top left of the painting, in the sky, is a barely legible pencil inscription: 'Kan kun være malet af en gal Mand!' ('Can only have been painted by a madman!')",
   "source": "https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/collection/object/NG.M.00939 ; https://www.cbsnews.com/news/the-scream-hidden-message-edvard-munch-painted-by-a-madman/ ; https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2021/02/22/munch-vandalised-own-scream-painting-declaring-himself-a-madman-new-research-finds ; checked on the Commons scan: pencil in the red band of sky, upper left"
  },
  {
   "claim": "The inscription is first mentioned in 1904, in connection with an exhibition in Copenhagen, when a Danish art critic thought a member of the public had written it",
   "source": "https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/stories/explore-the-collection/munch-malet-av-gal-mann-engelsk/ ; https://jerz.setonhill.edu/blog/2021/03/14/infrared-photo-confirms-munch-wrote-madman-inscription-first-noticed-in-1904/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "It was long/widely believed to be vandalism by a viewer",
   "source": "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/the-scream-hidden-message-edvard-munch-painted-by-a-madman/ ; https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2021/02/22/munch-vandalised-own-scream-painting-declaring-himself-a-madman-new-research-finds ; https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/who-wrote-cryptic-graffiti-edvard-munchs-scream-180977075/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "February 2021: the National Museum of Norway, preparing the painting for its new building, used infrared imaging and compared the writing with Munch's letters and diaries; curator Mai Britt Guleng: 'The writing is without a doubt Munch's own'",
   "source": "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/the-scream-hidden-message-edvard-munch-painted-by-a-madman/ ; https://www.livescience.com/scream-inscription-written-munch-himself.html ; https://apollo-magazine.com/munch-secret-message-scream/ ; https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/stories/explore-the-collection/munch-malet-av-gal-mann-engelsk/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "Autumn 1895: Munch exhibited at Blomqvist's in Kristiania (today's Oslo), including the 1893 Scream and Self-Portrait with Cigarette",
   "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-Portrait_with_Cigarette ; https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/stories/explore-the-collection/munch-malet-av-gal-mann-engelsk/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "At an 1895 debate at the Student Society, medical student Johan Scharffenberg said Munch's paintings, particularly Self-Portrait with Cigarette, gave him reason to question the artist's sanity",
   "source": "https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2021/02/22/munch-vandalised-own-scream-painting-declaring-himself-a-madman-new-research-finds ; https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/stories/explore-the-collection/munch-malet-av-gal-mann-engelsk/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "The museum: 'It is likely that Munch added the inscription in 1895, or shortly after, in response to the judgment on his work' (hedged in narration: 'The museum thinks')",
   "source": "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/the-scream-hidden-message-edvard-munch-painted-by-a-madman/ ; https://apollo-magazine.com/munch-secret-message-scream/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "Guleng reads the inscription as an ironic comment (a way of taking back control); hedged as the curator's reading",
   "source": "https://apollo-magazine.com/munch-secret-message-scream/ ; https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/the-famed-painting-the-scream-holds-a-hidden-message/ ; https://hyperallergic.com/624180/edvard-munch-the-scream-madman-message/"
  },
  {
   "claim": "Munch was deeply hurt: for years he referred to the comments in his notes",
   "source": "https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2021/02/22/munch-vandalised-own-scream-painting-declaring-himself-a-madman-new-research-finds ; https://hyperallergic.com/624180/edvard-munch-the-scream-madman-message/"
  },
  {
